        "text": "Kristyna Colleen Ryan was elected to the circuit court in 2008 and has served in the Fourth Municipal District in Maywood since 2010, hearing mental health and veterans treatment cases. Before taking the bench, she was in private practice. In 2024, an appellate court vacated her pretrial detention order in People v. Stokes, finding the State failed to provide a factual basis.",
